Prague Sky Model

The numbers in sun10.json are values of sky radiance computed with the Prague Sky Model, by the
reference implementation and the datasets published by its authors. No part of the model's source
code or of its datasets is included in this repository; only the numbers it produced for the
configurations listed in PROVENANCE.md.

